          "content": {
            "size": 6308,
            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "compression": 0,
            "text": "/* ============================================\n   Mojavez Gateway — Design Tokens\n   Single source of truth for all visual decisions.\n   Direction (per ECC frontend-design-direction): this is an operational tool\n   used daily → dense, quiet, scannable. No decorative gradients, no cards in\n   cards, no oversized hero text. Hierarchy through scale + weight, not color.\n   ============================================ */\n\n:root {\n  /* ---- Color palette: semantic, multi-dimensional (not one-hue) ---- */\n  /* Brand: a calm slate blue for primary actions. */\n  --c-primary: #1e40af;\n  --c-primary-hover: #1e3a8a;\n  --c-primary-soft: rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.08);\n  /* Accent: amber for status/attention (sparse use only). */\n  --c-accent: #b45309;\n  --c-accent-soft: rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.10);\n  /* Status */\n  --c-success: #047857;\n  --c-success-soft: rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.12);\n  --c-danger: #b91c1c;\n  --c-danger-soft: rgba(185, 28, 28, 0.10);\n  --c-warning: #b45309;\n  --c-warning-soft: rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.12);\n  --c-info: #1e40af;\n  --c-info-soft: rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.10);\n\n  /* Neutral surfaces — layered for depth */\n  --c-bg: #f1f5f9;          /* app canvas */\n  --c-surface: #ffffff;     /* cards, sidebar, nav */\n  --c-surface-raised: #ffffff; /* modals, toasts */\n  --c-surface-sunken: #e2e8f0; /* inset / hover wells */\n\n  /* Text */\n  --c-text: #0f172a;\n  --c-text-strong: #020617;\n  --c-text-muted: #475569;\n  --c-text-subtle: #64748b;\n  --c-text-on-primary: #ffffff;\n\n  /* Lines */\n  --c-border: #cbd5e1;\n  --c-border-strong: #94a3b8;\n  --c-border-subtle: #e2e8f0;\n\n  /* ---- Typography scale (1.250 ratio, dense tool) ---- */\n  --font-base: 'Vazirmatn', 'Tahoma', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: 'Vazirmatn', ui-monospace, 'Consolas', monospace;\n\n  --fs-xs: 0.75rem;     /* 12px — captions, badges */\n  --fs-sm: 0.8125rem;   /* 13px — secondary text, table cells */\n  --fs-base: 0.9375rem; /* 15px — body */\n  --fs-md: 1rem;        /* 16px — section titles, button labels */\n  --fs-lg: 1.25rem;     /* 20px — page title */\n  --fs-xl: 1.5rem;      /* 24px — hero numbers */\n\n  --fw-regular: 400;\n  --fw-medium: 500;\n  --fw-semibold: 600;\n  --fw-bold: 700;\n\n  --lh-tight: 1.25;\n  --lh-base: 1.5;\n  --lh-relaxed: 1.65;\n\n  /* ---- Spacing scale (4px base, intentional rhythm) ---- */\n  --sp-0: 0;\n  --sp-1: 4px;\n  --sp-2: 8px;\n  --sp-3: 12px;\n  --sp-4: 16px;\n  --sp-5: 20px;\n  --sp-6: 24px;\n  --sp-8: 32px;\n  --sp-10: 40px;\n  --sp-12: 48px;\n\n  /* ---- Radii (intentional, not uniform) ---- */\n  --r-none: 0;\n  --r-sm: 4px;     /* inputs, badges */\n  --r-md: 6px;     /* buttons, table cells */\n  --r-lg: 8px;     /* cards */\n  --r-xl: 12px;    /* modals */\n  --r-pill: 999px;\n\n  /* ---- Shadows (subtle, layered) ---- */\n  --sh-xs: 0 1px 0 rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);\n  --sh-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06), 0 1px 1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);\n  --sh-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);\n  --sh-lg: 0 12px 32px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.14);\n  --sh-focus: 0 0 0 3px rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.30);\n\n  /* ---- Motion ---- */\n  --t-fast: 120ms ease;\n  --t-base: 180ms ease;\n  --t-slow: 260ms ease;\n\n  /* ---- Layout metrics ---- */\n  --nav-height: 56px;\n  --sidebar-width: 300px;\n  --main-max: 1440px;\n  --touch-target: 44px; /* a11y: minimum tap target */\n}\n\n/* ---- Dark mode override (intentional, not auto-default) ---- */\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  :root {\n    --c-primary: #60a5fa;\n    --c-primary-hover: #93c5fd;\n    --c-primary-soft: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.16);\n    --c-accent: #fbbf24;\n    --c-accent-soft: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.16);\n\n    --c-success: #34d399;\n    --c-success-soft: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.16);\n    --c-danger: #f87171;\n    --c-danger-soft: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.16);\n    --c-warning: #fbbf24;\n    --c-warning-soft: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.16);\n\n    --c-bg: #0b1220;\n    --c-surface: #111827;\n    --c-surface-raised: #1e293b;\n    --c-surface-sunken: #0b1220;\n\n    --c-text: #e2e8f0;\n    --c-text-strong: #f1f5f9;\n    --c-text-muted: #94a3b8;\n    --c-text-subtle: #64748b;\n\n    --c-border: #1e293b;\n    --c-border-strong: #334155;\n    --c-border-subtle: #1e293b;\n\n    --sh-xs: 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    --sh-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    --sh-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n    --sh-lg: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n    --sh-focus: 0 0 0 3px rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.40);\n  }\n}\n\n/* ---- Backward-compat aliases (so existing CSS that references the old\n   token names keeps working while we migrate). Once all consumers use the\n   new --c-* names, these aliases can be removed. ---- */\n:root {\n  --primary: var(--c-primary);\n  --primary-dark: var(--c-primary-hover);\n  --accent: var(--c-accent);\n  --success: var(--c-success);\n  --danger: var(--c-danger);\n  --bg: var(--c-bg);\n  --bg-card: var(--c-surface);\n  --text: var(--c-text);\n  --text-muted: var(--c-text-muted);\n  --border: var(--c-border);\n  --radius: var(--r-lg);\n  --radius-sm: var(--r-sm);\n  --shadow-sm: var(--sh-sm);\n  --shadow-md: var(--sh-md);\n  --shadow-lg: var(--sh-lg);\n  --transition: var(--t-base);\n}\n\n/* ---- Reduced motion: respect user preference (a11y) ---- */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  *, *::before, *::after {\n    animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;\n    scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ---- Focus ring: visible, high-contrast, never removed ---- */\n:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--c-primary);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n  border-radius: var(--r-sm);\n}\n\n/* ---- Extended tokens: dashboard, density, activity, bento ---- */\n:root {\n  /* KPI card accents (semantic, mapped to palette above) */\n  --kpi-primary: var(--c-primary);\n  --kpi-success: var(--c-success);\n  --kpi-accent:  var(--c-accent);\n  --kpi-danger:  var(--c-danger);\n\n  /* Density tracks for the dashboard grid (Bento layout) */\n  --grid-gap: var(--sp-4);\n  --grid-gap-sm: var(--sp-3);\n\n  /* Activity feed dot sizes */\n  --dot-size: var(--sp-2);\n\n  /* Container widths */\n  --content-max: 1440px;\n  --content-narrow: 960px;\n  --content-wide: 1600px;\n\n  /* Nav height for sticky sub-headers */\n  --sub-header-height: 48px;\n\n  /* Z-index scale (one source of truth) */\n  --z-base: 1;\n  --z-sticky: 100;\n  --z-backdrop: 99;\n  --z-modal: 500;\n  --z-toast: 1000;\n  --z-tooltip: 1100;\n}\n"
          },
